(cid:120) the costs of future commercializing activities, including product sales, marketing, manufacturing and distribution, of
any of our drug candidates or other products for which marketing approval has been obtained;
(cid:120) our ability to establish strategic collaborations and licensing or other arrangements on terms favorable to us; and
(cid:120) competing technological and market developments.
